{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1463786-primal-utility-as-a-tool-of-espionage","id":1463786,"title":"Primal Utility as a tool of Espionage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-10-13T21:08:59-07:00","id":1463786,"title":"Primal Utility as a tool of Espionage","content":"The word &quot;Venture&quot; has a lot of possible definitions. Usually, it's a business. Establishing front-companies is standard practice for intelligence operations. So, I was thinking: How could a Syndicate Mage combine Primal Utility with other Spheres to enable spying on or otherwise screwing over Tradition targets?<br /> <br /> In one plot, I have a company listed on the stock market that is the subject of false rumors circulated to Tradition Mages who are enticed into insider trading. A Syndicate Mage is the majority shareholder. What could he do with PU and other Spheres (PU+) to affect the targets that wouldn't be possible without PU?<br /> <br /> Like the standard version, Primal Utility allows Enchanting. So, an investment in physical infrastructure could facilitate PU+ Procedures. To come up with an example... Cult of Ecstasy, Dreamspeakers and other mystics might be the perfect clientele for a commercial Sensory Deprivation Tank rental business. Hidden brain imaging cameras could be installed in the tanks to collect neuro-data. Add a full color camera fixed on the client's face and you can do biometric analysis in real time. Microphones record heart rate. Initially, the PU+ Mage would want to attract sleeper mystics who have no means of detecting the hidden gear. <br /> <br /> With PU and Mind, the Syndicate Spy could draw from the experiences being had to generate an enticing Resonance that is so irresistible that potential Mage clients forgo cautionary investigation of the location. A CoE Mage has such a great time that s/he decides to buy the business. The data collected from the tank is used to inform price negotiation with other subtle coincidental Magick. To sweeten the deal, the PU+ Spy lets the Ecstatic start refurbishing before the postdated check goes through. At the moment the check clears, Liquidate Venture is done in combination with Entropy to extract Quintessence and change the Resonance to the disadvantage of the buyer. What else could you do? <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6kAgg2aLT08\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6kAgg2aLT08\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6kAgg2aLT08\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6kAgg2aLT08 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isolation_tank\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/Flotation_Tank_Isolation_Tank.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isolation_tank\" target=\"_blank\"> Isolation tank - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isolation_tank\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isolation_tank </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-14T01:20:07-07:00","id":1463808,"title":"","content":"The problem with this plan is that the victim can still use Prime to detect the flow of energy from the Venture once they get there. The tank itself may work, but is just a usual Device.<br /> <br /> What I think may be useful for this spy is to explore to the maximum the immaterial aspect of the Primal Venture. But if your Venture is primarily a factory or lab, then it is rendered material again. Ventures are ideas-turned-nodes, and if the character explores this correctly you have a Node that not only can be used from afar, but is impossible for your enemies to locate because it literally have no location.<br /> <br /> A franchise or a brand, for example. The character have a company that just licenses other people to use their brand and formulas for something, without actually owning a single place that implements them. It may be a soft drink, for example. The flow of Quintessence can be detected, but its origin is untraceable. It doesn't come from any particular place that operates the business, it comes from the brand itself. <i>And each bottle is an extension of your Node</i>. In our current age of Companies-as-Apps, this is even more powerful.<br /> <br /> Companies can also work through numerous proxies. A bottle of soft drink is a part of its brand, but also of the company that made the bottle, the one that delivered the sand, the one that transported it, the companies behind each ingredient, container, labels, adds. Behind each consumer item there is a network of logistics. And behind most companies there are parent companies, and even companies specialized in investing their own capital in other companies, a rabbit hole that can further hide the origin point of a Primal Venture.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-14T03:22:30-07:00","id":1463812,"title":"","content":"I think those damn things that people buy and bring into their private homes, Alexa, Google and other devices of this type, would be a perfect examples of a hidden Venture that profits from eavesdropping. All kinds of insidious Techno-Magick can be diffused through the networks they run on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Post